    "message": "Split the former round-2 tests by owner and scope\n\nEach test now sits beside the module it checks: LLM accounting, usage\nledgers, drafts and assets, Project storage, history cursors, model\nstate contracts, recorded-answer replay and the Project screen's\npreview. The two usage CLI tests go to tests/integration because they\ngo through the CLI. The shared store and fake provider become\nfixtures in tests/conftest.py, and the preview test uses the shared\nui_project_api instead of stubbing the regional research itself. What\neach test checks is unchanged (#115).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
