    "message": "Split the former round-3 tests by owner\n\nCheckpoint section pages, signed scan progress and experiment cell\npreparation stay in tests/unit/storage; indexed history search joins\nthe history cursor test in tests/unit/web/test_project_queries.py, and\nthe temporary-absence record joins the population lifecycle tests.\nOnly formatting changes; what each test checks is unchanged (#115).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
